  "description": "Fifth plain-Symfony instance, a monorepo: Mautic 5 (Symfony 5.4, PHP 8.1) on its 5.x branch in September 2024, snapshot 2024-11-20. The application's own code is the path package mautic/core-lib, so every finding is transitive through it. Seven advisories on six Symfony components and Twig are plain updates that one combined command fixes. Nine PhpSpreadsheet advisories have no fix: mautic/core-lib requires phpoffice/phpspreadsheet ^1.15 <1.28 while the fixes start at 1.29.4; only editing the monorepo's own constraint would help, which is outside a remediation planner's remit. The project needs ext-imap, which the fixture's platform declares.",
